  "ingredients": [
    "1.33300000429153 cups white sugar, divided",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 large egg, beaten",
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.33300000429153 cup vegetable oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PLINVSJBdEb1vohCqd1R8cj4WTs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-ingredients-0662-af6f1c2833864a49991b820aa4145065.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x5-inch loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together 1/3 cup sugar and 2 teaspoons cinnamon in a small bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AjbI3hC1mr0XUk-VrrTMVyIlXOw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-01-0666-0857b2a44e5b4513ad8c8d4f5317cbe6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, remaining 1 cup sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl. Combine egg, milk, and oil in a separate bowl; add to flour mixture. Stir until just moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cl_PiL6QGZJ-4zSi_rxuEH4WhoM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-02-0675-0d28962cdede47a49684b8a7190f2899.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 1/2 of the batter into the prepared pan. Sprinkle with 1/2 of the reserved cinnamon-sugar mixture. Repeat with remaining batter and cinnamon-sugar mixture. Draw a knife through batter to marble.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oE4klXfcD9Hvtvg3iMKV4Jyzj68=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-04-0682-93aa8d0e8b74492ea4425c536aa80a35.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the loaf comes out clean, 45 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-6Uc2DNm6s7RjK3USxCBxRRoDxI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-05-0726-645a43f0fd8c4e1eb98ae1cdf620344f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool in the pan for 10 minutes before removing to a wire rack to cool completely. Wrap in foil and let sit overnight before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f2XNQj6y8llMHV3rCa8fvi8xqcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-06-0765-b232f218db1345c49253ccb9a49526f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/flMX39PAckZCdr7bxYDsuJc6JjY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23376-cinnamon-swirl-bread-ddmfs-hero-3x4-0811-ce6ebd2d3283478cbf810fb06e87e3d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23376/step_08.webp"
    }
